                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makamu makamu aabantu bako, boonse bakalebwa, bawa, baamba umwi aumwi kumweenzinyina kuti, Amunyamuke, tupiluke kubantu besu akunyika yabuzyalwe bwesu, nkaambo kapanga lyasikupenzya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
