              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli. Ncobeni njoouma Amoni waku-No, a-Farao, acisi ca-Egepita abaleza baco abami baco, a-Farao aboonse bamusyoma. ",
          "type": "text",
