                  "text": "49:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoobaaba mumaanza aabaabo bayanda kunyonyoona buumi bwabo, nkukuti mumaanza aa-Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni amumaanza aabalanda bakwe. Lino kusule lyayaaya cisi ca-Egepita ciyookalwa mbubonya mbuli mumazuba aakalekale, mbwaamba Jehova,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.26",
