                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino webo, utayoowi, O Jakobo mulanda wangu, Utakankami, O Israyeli. Nkaambo ncobeni njookufutula kuzwa kule, alunyungu lwako njoolufutula munyika yabuzike bwalo, Lino Jakobo uyoopiluka, uyookala aluumuno, nkabela takukooyooba naba omwe uumukataazya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
