          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utayoowi, o Jakobo mulanda wangu, mbwaamba Jehova, nkaambo mebo ndi anywe. Misyobo yoonse njindakamumwayila akati kayo, njooimaninizya, pele nywebo nsikooyoomumaninizya pe. Njoomuuma muciyanza ceelede buyo, nsikooyoomuleka buyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.28",
